# Only source, scripts and notes go in git. Never game files, dumps, builds, test binaries, saves or test output.
# 1. Files: only names with an extension (source, scripts, data), plus the few text files listed. A test binary
#    (extensionless Mach-O / ELF, e.g. pvp_test_bin) is never added.
*
!*/
!*.*
!Makefile
!LICENSE
!Changelog
!VERSION
!/gallery/test/data/api/gallery
# 2. Top level: only these.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/ROADMAP.md
!/NOTES.md
!/LICENSE
!/mp_pin.txt
!/build.sh
!/build_module.sh
!/cm_module.c
!/cm_mp.c
!/mod.json
!/builder/
!/fe/
!/fights/
!/gallery/
!/home/
!/pvp/
!/units/
# 3. Binaries, debug files, game files and dumps (copyright: never publish)
*_bin
*.dSYM/
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe
*.dat
*.so
*.o
*.a
*.obj
*.pdb
*.bundle
*.assets
dump/
dump.cs
il2cpp.h
script.json
methods.tsv
# 4. Builds, copies, test output
build/
build_*/
old/
old_versions/
out/
tmp/
*.zip
*.png
*.jpg
*.log
*.out
*.orig
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.lock
.DS_Store
backups/
saves/
*AutoSave*
